WEBVTT

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:08.730
Let's go over that again. Just the horn and flute,
starting with the second measure.

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:09.880
Okay!

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:17.410
Sorry...

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:22.560
Sensei!

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:01.490
I'm Iwasaki, president of the
Fujigasaki High concert band.

00:02:01.490 --> 00:02:02.980
And I'm Matsuda, the vice president.

00:02:03.610 --> 00:02:09.860
We're extremely sorry for the trouble
we caused Kusakabe-sensei and all of you.

00:02:10.610 --> 00:02:12.060
Bring me the gorilla's head on a pike.

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:13.810
Don't call him that!

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:15.480
Give back Kusakabe-sensei!

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:17.160
Calm down, Akari!

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:21.570
Thankfully, our advisor only had to get an IV.
He was discharged this afternoon.

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:23.240
The diagnosis was anemia and overwork.

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:25.910
I'll admit that we've also been overly dependent on him.

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:28.960
Apparently he hadn't taken
a single day off since April.

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:33.790
So why is he overseeing
Fujigasaki's rehearsals too?

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:35.890
I hope you have a reasonable
explanation for this.

00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:40.960
Do you remember Sakai-sensei, our advisor?

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:41.970
You mean the gorilla?

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:42.840
Hey!

00:02:43.270 --> 00:02:46.930
The thing is, he suddenly got suspended.

00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:50.960
We don't know why either.

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:55.270
And we haven't finished arranging the
free-choice piece, which he was in charge of.

00:02:56.040 --> 00:03:00.850
Kusakabe-sensei heard about it
and offered to help us.

00:03:00.850 --> 00:03:02.330
Has the gorilla's suspension been lifted?

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:03.860
Not yet.

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:08.320
That means Kusakabe-sensei will have
to oversee your rehearsals again!

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:09.030
Yeah!

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:12.090
What do you mean, you don't know
why he was suspended?

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:17.130
Possible reasons include corporal punishment,
leaking exam material, and sexual harassment.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:19.550
Sakai-sensei would never!

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:23.300
He may have a sharp tongue,
but he always does the right thing.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:25.990
Then why would he get suspended?

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:31.870
What kind of problem could a popular
veteran teacher be unable to resolve?

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:32.850
Um...

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:37.770
Sakai-sensei's my homeroom teacher,
and something strange happened recently.

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:39.150
What was it?

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:42.900
Our seating arrangement was changed
thrice in just the last month.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:45.530
What? Thrice?

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:47.250
And it was Sakai-sensei
who ordered it, I assume?

00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:48.660
Yes.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:51.770
When we asked him why,
he just glared at us and said nothing.

00:03:52.550 --> 00:03:55.910
Matsuda-san, take me to that classroom.

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:59.370
As things stand, both our bands will implode.

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:02.340
So I'm going to figure out the truth
behind the gorilla's suspension!

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:05.560
Who is this guy?

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:07.880
"High schooler" is just his cover.

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:10.890
He's actually a super sleuth
with an abundance of grey cells.

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:12.090
That's right.

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:14.930
I'll be Kusakabe-sensei's
knight in shining armour!

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:18.470
Wait, wait, wait!

00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:19.700
Count me in as well!

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:23.070
And that's the blooper sleuth with cray cells.

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:24.790
The two come together,
like a hamburger meal.

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:27.750
I'm the burger and Chika-chan's the fries!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:30.240
See? They're perfectly in sync.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:33.460
I hear Kusakabe-sensei's in trouble?

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:38.470
I owe him big-time for all he's done for me.

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:40.880
Make that two plus one,
the three musketeers happy meal.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.200
I'll go with you.

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:44.250
All right. You have one day to settle this.

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:46.460
You will help us, right?

00:04:52.970 --> 00:04:56.390
The weather's much more pleasant
today than yesterday.

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:00.790
They weren't flashy, but the girls
we just passed had manicures.

00:05:00.790 --> 00:05:02.280
Have you ever given yourself one?

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.000
I don't know how.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:06.640
Atta girl. Stay like that until we graduate.

00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:07.450
What the heck?

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:10.230
Is that the school bell?

00:05:10.230 --> 00:05:10.910
Yeah.

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:12.720
Way too fancy.

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:17.750
Hey, our school plays the Westminster Quarters.
It's a classic melody in its own right.

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:19.760
Their uniforms have style, too.

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:20.930
I can't go back!

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:23.000
I'm going to become part
of the Fujigasaki family!

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:27.040
The standards here are way
too high for you and me.

00:05:29.070 --> 00:05:32.720
Is there anyone we can ask for
precise information on the gorilla?

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:34.650
That would be Oogawara-sensei.

00:05:34.650 --> 00:05:36.760
We're meeting a teacher right off the bat?

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:39.850
Won't they find out we're
not Fujigasaki students?

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:41.400
We'll be fine.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:45.240
She's only a student teacher
under Sakai-sensei's supervision.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:47.210
Head to the classroom.

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:49.550
I'll go get Oogawara-sensei.

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:53.320
No students stayed back?

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:57.120
We asked for this room to be kept free
for the concert band's part practice.

00:05:57.680 --> 00:06:00.390
Wow, they have air conditioning.

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:03.040
Meanwhile, we don't even have ceiling fans.

00:06:03.740 --> 00:06:05.000
It's a control panel.

00:06:05.430 --> 00:06:07.920
Are students free to adjust the temperature?

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:10.920
Yes. But it often breaks down,

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:13.620
like a couple of weeks ago in this class.

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:17.720
It was one humid day after another,
and the school store ran out of face towels.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:20.180
I've brought Oogawara-sensei.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:30.780
I realise you're troubled by what's going on,
but you can't bring outsiders in like this.

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:32.000
She found out right away?!

00:06:32.430 --> 00:06:34.780
You're practically giving yourselves away.

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:35.860
With these?

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:36.790
Right.

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:40.400
Three students all wearing guest slippers
stick out like a sore thumb.

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:43.030
You don't exactly blend in yourself.

00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:45.460
You certainly don't look like
the usual student teacher.

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:48.260
And why is that?

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:52.560
That perfectly worn suit,
and your unusually calm demeanour.

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:56.850
And your makeup softens rather than highlights.

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:57.860
Nicely done.

00:06:58.510 --> 00:07:01.790
For a boy, you sure do notice
some peculiar things.

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:05.840
I know a bunch of senior citizens
who fill my head with useless trivia.

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:11.160
You got me. And to think people
often think I look younger than I am...

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:13.360
I'm Oogawara Yuka.

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:16.240
I'm thirty-one, but I'll have you know
I <i>am</i> actually a student.

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:18.910
Did you enter college late?

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:23.660
I was twenty-six when I joined a
night college while working full-time.

00:07:23.660 --> 00:07:27.230
This is my alma mater, and Sakai-sensei
was my homeroom teacher.

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:29.420
You also went to the
school of hard knocks, huh?

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:33.090
Well, get going before any
other teachers find you.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:37.170
Sensei, we want to bring back Sakai-sensei

00:07:37.170 --> 00:07:39.680
by figuring out what happened in this class.

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:40.560
Same here.

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:45.760
Let's just say we transferred into this school
today and will transfer out tomorrow.

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:47.510
Call us nomadic students.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:55.820
Starting now, you're my friends.

00:07:56.350 --> 00:07:58.020
If anyone asks, say I invited you.

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:04.440
You weren't told why he was suspended either?

00:08:04.440 --> 00:08:05.680
No.

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:07.340
Have you heard anything from Sakai-sensei?

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:10.630
When I asked him about the
suspension, all he said was,

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:16.420
"You'll definitely become a teacher
the students need, so do your best."

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:19.270
That sounds awfully like...

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:21.470
..."I leave the rest to you".

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:26.890
What's the actual relationship between you two?

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:29.430
Having obscene thoughts, are we?

00:08:29.430 --> 00:08:31.540
Like maybe that we're lovers having an affair?

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:32.570
Just making sure.

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:41.670
Out of all the students he's taught,
I was probably his only regret.

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:44.810
I didn't graduate from this school.

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.540
To be more precise, I couldn't.

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:51.750
I broke school rules and was told to drop out
if I didn't want an expulsion on my record.

00:08:52.660 --> 00:08:57.090
As my homeroom teacher, he was the
only one who stuck up for me till the end.

00:08:57.620 --> 00:09:00.510
At the time, I found his zeal most annoying.

00:09:01.110 --> 00:09:03.950
I said some horrible things to him and dropped out.

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:08.180
I didn't speak to him for ages after that,

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:10.700
but I couldn't find a school that'd
take me in as a student teacher.

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:14.630
So I swallowed my pride and asked him.

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:18.780
What was his reaction when you got in touch?

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:20.420
He roared like a gorilla.

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:21.770
Huh?

00:09:21.770 --> 00:09:23.830
He laughed, cried, and howled.

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:26.240
Sounds like him, all right.

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:31.800
Given how much you owe him,
I assume you investigated this whole thing?

00:09:32.930 --> 00:09:36.010
I figured out 70% of the facts.

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:38.130
The other 30% is still a mystery.

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:40.130
And what is that?

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:45.440
If you can get close to the 70% I know
all by yourselves, I'll tell you.

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:47.780
It's a difficult subject to talk about.

00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:49.480
No problem.

00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:53.770
With my acumen, Kaiyuu's knowledge,
and Chika-chan's...

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:55.330
energy, if nothing else—

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:01.090
Let's move on to the seating
arrangement changes in this class.

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:05.220
It was Sakai-sensei who suggested them, right?

00:10:05.220 --> 00:10:08.770
Yes, but at the behest of a certain student.

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:09.800
And who was that?

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:11.660
The class rep.

00:10:11.660 --> 00:10:14.970
So only the class rep knows why
the seating arrangement was changed.

00:10:14.970 --> 00:10:19.350
Yes, but apparently she hasn't
even told her close friends.

00:10:20.610 --> 00:10:21.380
What are these?

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:24.300
Seating charts Matsuda-san and I made.

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:28.090
They look like battle formations or something.

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:32.780
It almost seems like the class rep
was running from something.

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:35.930
Maybe there was a stalker of sorts
among the guys in class?

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:39.280
What'd be the point of running
around inside the classroom?

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:42.700
A guy messing with her, then?

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:46.370
Maybe he threw bits of pencil eraser
or scrap letters at her.

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:48.870
She could've just told him to stop.

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:52.790
I bet she couldn't tell who it was
because they were all breaking balls.

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:54.330
Quite the imaginative
train of thought.

00:10:55.810 --> 00:10:58.180
Sorry for going off the rails.

00:10:58.180 --> 00:11:00.610
Actually, I think you might be on to something.

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:03.340
Look at the third chart.

00:11:03.340 --> 00:11:07.170
It looks like the class rep is having
the rest of the girls protect her.

00:11:07.820 --> 00:11:09.140
Yeah.

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:12.850
There must be a reason she was forced into this.

00:11:13.490 --> 00:11:16.270
Did anything unusual happen around that time?

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:20.440
That'd be from the last week of May
to the second week of June...

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:22.410
Hydrangea season?

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:23.610
The summer monsoon?

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:25.830
The change to summer uniforms?

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:31.830
That reminds me. Sakai-sensei asked me to
lend him my mobile phone after school one day.

00:11:32.280 --> 00:11:36.790
He walked around the classroom, pointing it here and there.

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:38.790
So he was taking pictures with the camera?

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:42.760
I think he was only looking
through the viewfinder.

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:44.970
There weren't any images left in its memory.

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:46.260
Just looking?

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:50.810
Would you say the class rep is particularly cute?

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:55.460
She won the Miss Fujigasaki pageant
at last year's cultural festival.

00:11:55.460 --> 00:11:56.640
I see.

00:11:56.640 --> 00:11:59.230
I think I figured out why the seating
arrangement was changed.

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:05.360
It wasn't bits of eraser or letters on scrap paper
that were flying around the classroom,

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:07.740
but the gaze of a camera.

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:13.290
Sakai-sensei was trying to identify which seat
the class rep had been photographed from.

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:14.660
Sneak shots.

00:12:15.050 --> 00:12:20.430
But even if you turned off the shutter noise,
it wouldn't be easy to take photos unnoticed.

00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:21.500
What about video?

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:25.850
Maybe they had a video camera film everything
and took what they wanted from the footage.

00:12:27.670 --> 00:12:32.950
Looks like you've taken one step closer
to Asmodeus, the peeping tom.

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:42.120
Asmodeus?

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:45.200
One of the demons King Solomon sealed.

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:47.680
The demon of lust.

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:54.540
Starting last year, a student going by that name
has been uploading images of schoolgirls online.

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:59.130
Their faces were never shown,
but their uniform could be identified.

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:01.770
The class rep was the first to notice,

00:13:01.770 --> 00:13:04.720
because she'd been targeted herself.

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:08.520
The uploads increased greatly in number
soon after the switch to summer uniforms.

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:10.400
What a scumbag.

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:16.210
The class rep confided in Sakai-sensei
about this and tried to catch Asmodeus.

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:18.610
Did you see the images in question?

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:20.360
No, I didn't.

00:13:20.810 --> 00:13:24.530
Do people really get turned on by
looking at pictures of girls in class?

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:26.490
Why are you asking <i>me</i> that?!

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:33.370
I'm just wondering why they'd pick Asmodeus,
the demon of lust, as their alias.

00:13:33.820 --> 00:13:35.040
Don't tell me...

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:39.500
Who are you calling?

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:41.220
Someone I know from FM Hagoromo.

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:43.080
I want to check something.

00:13:43.950 --> 00:13:46.680
Hello? This is Kaiyu, from Suirenji.

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:48.390
Long time no talk!

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:50.660
Who is he?

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:52.810
A former radio host.

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:54.810
He's got lots of adult connections.

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:00.780
I knew it.

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:05.280
Asmodeus was probably using an infrared camera.

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:07.240
An infrared camera?

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:12.580
Apparently infrared rays look like shining
white light through a digital camera's viewfinder.

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:17.840
That's probably what Sakai-sensei
was looking for using the phone's camera.

00:14:18.360 --> 00:14:19.610
What are you talking about?

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:22.610
Infrared cameras have two unique properties.

00:14:22.610 --> 00:14:24.840
One, you can use them in the dark.

00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:29.310
And two, you can see through light clothing.

00:14:30.520 --> 00:14:33.140
So that's why the uploads
increased after the switch.

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:36.260
With these seating changes,
the class rep acted as a decoy—

00:14:36.260 --> 00:14:40.440
and Sakai-sensei as the mastermind—
to challenge Asmodeus.

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:42.990
It makes sense if you think about it that way.

00:14:42.990 --> 00:14:45.220
Was the culprit found?

00:14:45.220 --> 00:14:48.950
Yes, but only Sakai-sensei knows who it is.

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:52.460
That's awful! How could he let a guy like that go?

00:14:52.460 --> 00:14:53.790
Might not necessarily be a guy.

00:14:54.770 --> 00:14:58.080
The row behind the class rep was all girls.

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:01.460
That's right. Asmodeus turned out to be a female student.

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:04.610
Normally, this case would be done and dusted.

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:08.800
They've identified the culprit,
so they just have to throw the book at them.

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:11.540
But the case isn't closed yet.

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:13.980
Sakai-sensei is still suspended.

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:16.680
That is the biggest mystery.

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:19.980
Sakai-sensei ended up covering for Asmodeus.

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:21.830
Covering for them?

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:27.490
He hasn't even told the class rep
or the principal the reason why.

00:15:27.890 --> 00:15:34.370
I heard that after he visited Asmodeus's home,
he backed off all of a sudden.

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:37.370
Can we meet the class rep?

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:38.210
That's...

00:15:38.210 --> 00:15:39.410
We can.

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:40.290
Matsuda-san...

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:43.330
We'll ask her by ourselves.

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:48.090
The Shimizu Minami concert band?

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:52.700
That's right. Sakai-sensei's
suspension is hurting us too.

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:54.850
Sorry for causing you trouble.

00:15:55.450 --> 00:16:00.190
What did he tell you after
he visited Asmodeus's place?

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:04.570
Let me deal with her, please.

00:16:04.570 --> 00:16:08.240
I'm not asking you to suspend or expel her.

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:13.290
I just want an apology and a promise never
to take pictures without permission again.

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:14.600
I know.

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:16.330
You can't get her to do that either?

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:18.750
Tell me why!

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:20.070
I'm sorry!

00:16:20.070 --> 00:16:24.750
I know that it's unreasonable to ask you
to let someone who hurt you go.

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:27.130
But please, I beg of you!

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:28.590
No way.

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:30.590
That wouldn't sit right with anyone.

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:33.980
So I went over his head to the principal.

00:16:33.980 --> 00:16:39.370
But Sakai-sensei wouldn't even tell the principal why.
He voluntarily took the suspension.

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:43.980
Are you saying Asmodeus is still
shamelessly coming to school?

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:46.920
You know that girl who's been absent recently?

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:49.940
She's probably Asmodeus.

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:53.980
She's apparently been depressed
ever since Sakai-sensei got suspended.

00:16:55.890 --> 00:16:57.020
I see.

00:16:57.020 --> 00:17:01.750
He could be trying to make her reflect on
her actions by taking the suspension.

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:05.100
Asmodeus is wracked with guilt,

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:10.370
but the class rep isn't satisfied,
and Sakai-sensei is still suspended...

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:13.970
Just what was it that he went so far to protect?

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:18.850
Asmodeus might've had some
kind of ace up their sleeve.

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:22.560
A trump card that'd silence Sakai-sensei?

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:25.190
You mean she might've had
photos of other students too?

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:30.250
That's possible, but it doesn't explain
Sakai-sensei's change in attitude.

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:31.430
Right.

00:17:31.430 --> 00:17:34.870
Just what did she see
beneath the summer uniforms?

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:38.200
Underwear risque enough to cause public outcry?

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:40.710
Maybe a huge mole, or a bruise?

00:17:40.710 --> 00:17:43.870
None of those would act as a trump card.

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:45.960
But I hadn't thought of that.

00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:51.630
Maybe in some cases, big scars or surgical ones
could be seen through clothing.

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:54.000
The air conditioning is turned off at 5PM.

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:55.440
It's a bit hot, isn't it?

00:17:58.370 --> 00:17:59.990
Couple of weeks ago...
One humid day after another...

00:17:59.990 --> 00:18:01.430
I didn't graduate... I couldn't.
Couple of weeks ago...
One humid day after another...

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:03.880
As my homeroom teacher, he was the
only one who stuck up for me till the end.

00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:09.200
"You'll definitely become a teacher
the students need, so do your best."

00:18:11.280 --> 00:18:12.160
Sensei!

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:15.680
Can you not handle air conditioning?

00:18:15.680 --> 00:18:16.590
Why do you ask?

00:18:16.590 --> 00:18:21.650
Everyone else is in summer clothes,
but you're still wearing a suit and scarf.

00:18:22.860 --> 00:18:26.210
You're always wearing a suit.

00:18:26.610 --> 00:18:27.500
Well, yes.

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:31.920
Were you still wearing one when the A/C
in this class broke down a couple weeks ago?

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:35.010
It was hot and humid,
so I had to take off my jacket...

00:18:37.370 --> 00:18:39.840
No way, me too?

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:44.900
Your reaction basically tells the whole story.

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:50.110
Asmodeus's trump card was a photograph
taken on the day the A/C broke down.

00:18:51.260 --> 00:18:54.200
Sakai-sensei wanted to protect
the subject of that photo:

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:58.200
his former student, and his only regret.

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:03.710
I was a fool for not realising until now.

00:19:04.360 --> 00:19:07.170
Thank you for solving the mystery.

00:19:07.170 --> 00:19:08.990
Sensei?

00:19:08.990 --> 00:19:09.880
I'm sorry.

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:12.370
I didn't mean to deceive anyone.

00:19:12.370 --> 00:19:16.360
But my back still bears a relic of my past
I haven't completely erased.

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:19.600
A yakuza tattoo.

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:25.940
Kusakabe-sensei?!

00:19:27.590 --> 00:19:30.360
I'm here to pick up my students.

00:19:30.880 --> 00:19:33.230
You kids are busybodies to the bone, huh?

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:38.710
I'm Kusakabe, of Shimizu Minami High School.

00:19:38.710 --> 00:19:42.490
I've heard a lot about you from Sakai-sensei.

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:43.580
Likewise.

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:50.860
He told me that you could be capable
of succeeding at the things he failed to do.

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:55.410
Your deduction is right on the money.

00:19:55.410 --> 00:20:00.390
Sakai-sensei was threatened using a picture of Oogawara-sensei.

00:20:00.390 --> 00:20:02.810
But half of the yakuza tattoo
was already removed.

00:20:03.810 --> 00:20:06.880
I hear the removal process is extremely painful.

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:12.670
But she was going through it so she could
stand before her students without shame.

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:16.960
He said he felt hope in that fact.

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:19.750
Thank you.

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:22.050
But this is enough.

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:24.910
I want to free Sakai-sensei.

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:29.220
I can't let him suffer any more to protect me.

00:20:29.220 --> 00:20:32.070
Are you going to give up teaching?

00:20:33.410 --> 00:20:35.670
I have to go see two of my students.

00:20:36.240 --> 00:20:39.170
One, a girl who was placed under a cruel gaze.

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:42.950
And the other, a sad, mistaken girl
who's been driven into a corner.

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:50.600
If I may be allowed to,
I'll go give them my first—and last—lesson.

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:01.990
Thank you, Nomadic Students.

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:03.960
"Nomadic students"?

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:10.290
Are you all right now, Sensei?

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:12.210
Sorry for making you worry.

00:21:13.150 --> 00:21:14.590
Sensei...

00:21:14.590 --> 00:21:15.210
What is it?

00:21:15.890 --> 00:21:21.840
Did we end up making her suffer,
like we did with Gotou-san's grandfather?

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:25.930
People, by nature,
have an insatiable thirst for knowledge.

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:29.800
And the knowledge they gain
can sometimes cause great pain.

00:21:30.780 --> 00:21:33.650
But Oogawara-sensei will be fine.

00:21:33.650 --> 00:21:35.640
She has Sakai-sensei on her side.

00:21:42.640 --> 00:21:45.320
I'm so sorry for all the trouble I caused.

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:52.040
Oogawara!

00:21:53.460 --> 00:21:59.210
I'll keep a student teacher spot open
next year, and the year after that...

00:22:05.710 --> 00:22:07.350
Okay, Sensei!

00:23:31.750 --> 00:23:32.640
That's my dog.

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:33.180
No...

00:23:33.180 --> 00:23:34.200
Finders keepers!

00:23:34.200 --> 00:23:35.370
Are you doing this for money?!

00:23:35.370 --> 00:23:36.750
Don't give up.

00:23:36.750 --> 00:23:40.320
This is the kind of article that's worthy of a deal.
